====
                    "description": f.description,
                    "proposed_fix": f.proposed_fix,
                    "verified": f.verified,
                    "escalated": getattr(f, "escalated", False),
                }
                for f in rnd
>>>>

**FOLLOW:**  
Checkpoints will now durably preserve escalation state. After a crash recovery, ESCALATED findings will correctly bypass the active finding pool, saving context budget.

